---
layout: base.njk
title: Pepper Farm Deli Blog | Santee Food, Sandwiches & Catering
description: Read Pepper Farm Deli's guides to sandwiches, breakfast, healthy options, soups, and catering in Santee, CA.
---

<main class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <header class="mb-8">
    <p class="text-lime-800 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Pepper Farm Deli · Santee, CA</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold mt-2">From the Pepper Farm Deli Blog</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-zinc-700 mt-3 max-w-3xl">Local guides to deli sandwiches, subs, breakfast, catering, and more in Santee.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6" aria-label="All blog articles">
    {% for article in localArticles %}
    <article class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-full">
      <img eleventy:images="500" class="w-full h-52 object-cover" src="{{ article.image }}{% if article.image[0] != '/' %}?w=500&h=320&fit=thumb{% endif %}" alt="{{ article.imageAlt }}" loading="lazy">
      <div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-1">
        <time class="text-sm text-lime-800 font-semibold" datetime="{{ article.date }}">{{ article.displayDate }}</time>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-2 mb-3"><a class="text-lime-950 hover:text-lime-800 hover:underline" href="/blog/{{ article.slug }}/">{{ article.title }}</a></h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-700 mb-5 flex-1">{{ article.description }}</p>
        <a class="text-lime-800 font-bold hover:underline mt-auto" href="/blog/{{ article.slug }}/">Read article <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}

    <article class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-full">
      <img eleventy:images="500" class="w-full h-52 object-cover" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/eldyi6e8kb6c/4Tw9ccdebdsBaF6xd7m2C/88a110182bb9406c440200c0c3f96b4c/for-all-cold_sandw-catering.webp?w=500&h=320&fit=thumb" alt="Sandwich catering platter for an office lunch" loading="lazy">
      <div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-1">
        <p class="text-sm text-lime-800 font-semibold">September 15, 2026</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-2 mb-3"><a class="text-lime-950 hover:text-lime-800 hover:underline" href="/blog/planning-an-office-lunch-in-santee/">Planning an Office Lunch in Santee: A Sandwich Catering Checklist</a></h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-700 mb-5 flex-1">A practical guide to planning a smooth group lunch, from headcounts and dietary needs to ordering and pickup timing.</p>
        <a class="text-lime-800 font-bold hover:underline mt-auto" href="/blog/planning-an-office-lunch-in-santee/">Read article <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>

    {% for post in blog %}
    <article class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-full">
      <img eleventy:images="500" class="w-full h-52 object-cover" src="{{ post.fields.thumbnail.fields.file.url | cfimg }}?w=500&h=320&fit=thumb" alt="{{ post.fields.title or post.fields.hero[0].fields.h1 }}" loading="lazy">
      <div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-1">
        <time class="text-sm text-lime-800 font-semibold" datetime="{{ post.sys.createdAt | w3c }}">{{ post.sys.createdAt | w3c }}</time>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-2 mb-3"><a class="text-lime-950 hover:text-lime-800 hover:underline" href="/blog/{{ post.fields.hero[0].fields.h1 | slugify }}/">{{ post.fields.hero[0].fields.h1 }}</a></h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-700 mb-5 flex-1">{{ post.fields.summary | safe }}</p>
        <a class="text-lime-800 font-bold hover:underline mt-auto" href="/blog/{{ post.fields.hero[0].fields.h1 | slugify }}/">Read article <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
</main>
